{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13440","headline":"古意 · 毕耀","name":"古意","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"璇闺绣户斜光入，千金女儿倚门立。\n横波美目虽往来，罗袂遥遥不相及。\n闻道今年初避人，珊珊挂镜长随身。\n愿得侍儿爲道意，後堂罗帐一相亲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"毕耀","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13440.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13440","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}